## About

A Python automation tool that uses FFmpeg and the YouTube Data API to render overlay text on videos, manage metadata from a CSV file, and automatically upload or schedule videos (daily or weekly).

- Renders custom on-video text using FFmpeg with configurable styling.
- Reads per-video titles, hashtags, and overlay text from a CSV file.
- Supports scheduled publishing via the YouTube Data API (e.g., every Monday at 9:00).
- Automatically moves processed videos to an archive folder.
